    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      349.2,
      561.97,
      371.27
    ],
    "text": "North: Lot No. 3517; East: Lot No. 3517; South: Lot No.3517 and 1622; West: Lot No. 1622.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      384.0,
      562.06,
      490.07
    ],
    "text": "The owner who claim ownership or have any other relationto the above described land/servitude or any person actingunder their written directions should meet me at DivisionalSecretariat Padiyathalawa on 09.01.2019 at 10.00 a.m. Further,the nature of ownership to the above land/servitude detailsof the reason to request compensation for land acquisition,the amount of compensation and the mode of calculation ofthe compensation should be submitted in written documentwith two copies on or before 09.01.2019.",
